please do not hesitate to contact us directly via Email/Slack/office-knock etc.  

# Peano Compiling

If you encouter issues in this stage, it is very likely due to an old compiler or supporting library. Please
make sure you load an as-new-as-possible Intel compiler and MPI module. Also please make sure you set the 
compiler correctly:

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
export I_MPI_CXX=icpx
./configure CC=icx CXX=icpx --with-mpi=mpiicpc --with-multithreading=omp CXXFLAGS="......
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

For more information on dependencies and prerequisites, please check the page \ref page_installation_home.

# To be continued...

